{"id": "21516", "revid": "162256", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=21516", "title": "Mars Hill (Maine)", "text": "Mars Hill is a town in the Aroostook region of Maine, nestled at the foot of Mars Hill Mountain.\nGet in.\nMars Hill is located along U.S. Highway 1. A border crossing at nearby Bridewater connects to New Brunswick, Canada.\nSleep.\n\"Additional lodging is available in nearby Presque Isle.\""}
